          </div>

          <div data-hf-id="hf-s9x2" id="v-card-3" class="v-card">
            <div data-hf-id="hf-kby7" class="v-card-num">03</div>
            <h3 data-hf-id="hf-00ez" class="v-card-title">Control de datos</h3>
            <p data-hf-id="hf-kx6o" class="v-card-body">
              Trazabilidad por panel, sesión y evaluador. Un solo registro auditable.
            </p>
            <div data-hf-id="hf-73hj" class="v-card-ghost" data-layout-ignore="true">03</div>
